# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# QUESTRA AI — FRONTEND ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values.
# On Vercel, set these in Project → Settings → Environment Variables.

# Gemini AI API Key (required for AI question generation)
# Get from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE

# Google OAuth Client ID (public — safe to expose)
# Get from: https://console.cloud.google.com/
VITE_REACT_APP_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Backend URL — use your Render service URL in production
VITE_BACKEND_URL=http://localhost:5000
